Game is Semi-playable;
I've played this game in the past and it has worked perfectly. But since recently, when I returned and wanted to start a new save, the game bugs out when the tutorial asks me to open a card pack. It doesn't matter when I do this step or what pack I open, but it always gives me a shiny Dracunix as the first card and it cause the game to softlock, I've tried multiple different save files and deleting old files that wouldn't let me play on them, tried re-installing the game and verifing the files but nothing seems to work.
Normally I wouldn't write a review like this, but I've had this problem since February 2026 and I'm just wondering if it's ever going to get fixed or not.
